FFDDTT CCOONNFFIIGGUURRAATTIIOONN
     On an fdt(4) based system, a ggppiiootthhss device node is typically defined di‐
     rectly under the root node, or under a simplebus node that represents a
     collection of devices on a board.

     The following properties are required in the ggppiiootthhss device subnode:

     _c_o_m_p_a_t_i_b_l_e
             Must be "dht11".

     _g_p_i_o_s   A reference to the gpio device and pin for data communications.

